WEBVTT

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:26.750
<i>New days, it's the morning we begin. 
Let's give the world a kiss.</i>

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:35.240
<i>Blowing in the wind, with a little 
courage and love in our pockets.</i>

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:44.090
<i>I wish: If only I had wings,</i>

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:53.690
<i>I could fly over the sadness, 
the past, and my doubts.</i>

00:00:53.690 --> 00:01:02.450
<i>Oh, yeah! There's nothing to lose. 
(Take whatever the brand new day brings.)</i>

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:07.290
<i>Take my way! I wanna catch a miracle...</i>

00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:11.030
<i>in the palm of my hand!</i>

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:19.720
<i>We're off on a journey through the endless 
earth, the skies, and the future.</i>

00:01:20.290 --> 00:01:32.140
<i>I know these newborn wings, oh! 
Are gonna gonna gonna shine someday!</i>

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:37.950
Do you suppose this was 
really made by humans?

00:01:38.310 --> 00:01:40.660
Either by humans or demons.

00:01:41.410 --> 00:01:46.540
Either way, it's probably a relic 
from before the Genesis Wars.

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:49.080
I wonder what it was used for.

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:51.890
C'mon, how much longer until the exit?

00:01:51.890 --> 00:01:52.590
Beats me.

00:01:52.950 --> 00:01:55.710
But we've been walking 
for two whole days now!

00:01:55.710 --> 00:01:58.550
There's nobody attacking us or 
anything, so what's the hurry?

00:01:58.900 --> 00:02:02.970
You might not care 'cause 
your brain's all moldy,

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:05.600
but I'm fed up with looking 
at these same walls!

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:07.350
I could bury you right there if you want.

00:02:07.350 --> 00:02:08.520
That sounds nice.

00:02:08.850 --> 00:02:10.070
There's the exit.

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:15.940
Yahoo!

00:02:15.940 --> 00:02:20.950
"Rhapsody of the Beast Princess"

00:02:24.030 --> 00:02:25.160
I'm through...

00:02:29.290 --> 00:02:31.140
What the heck is that?!

00:02:33.790 --> 00:02:36.010
I guess it must be the sea.

00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:38.550
That's amazing! There's no far shore!

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:41.970
That's how seas are supposed to be, you know?

00:02:41.970 --> 00:02:44.740
Right, like this isn't your 
first time seeing it, too.

00:02:44.740 --> 00:02:48.270
This is why it's so sad when 
your brain goes all moldy.

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:53.940
So, this is the Giat Empire...

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:55.100
Yeah.

00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:57.400
At the very least, we don't have 
to worry about being hunted

00:02:57.400 --> 00:02:59.200
by Leinwan's Royal Forces now.

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:02.200
Look, look! The shape of 
that cape there is so weird!

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:07.160
They're here, too...

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:09.390
Don't worry about it.

00:03:09.390 --> 00:03:11.670
For now, let's find a place 
to stay tonight and...

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:14.130
Raquel! Put up a barrier!

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:15.180
It won't do you any good.

00:03:16.190 --> 00:03:19.050
The arrows will reach you before 
the spell could take effect.

00:03:23.990 --> 00:03:26.600
Welcome, Scrapped Princess.

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:27.350
Who are you?

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:32.560
Third Princess of the Giat 
Empire, Senes Lur Giat.

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:35.310
Just like you, I'm one more 
princess than the country needs.

00:03:35.710 --> 00:03:36.980
Senes?

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:38.480
The Beast Princess, huh?

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:39.740
Beast Princess?

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:43.280
She's the director of the crisis 
management organization Scarlet.

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:45.220
Commonly known as the Beast Princess.

00:03:45.820 --> 00:03:47.150
I'm honored.

00:03:47.150 --> 00:03:49.750
They call me by that nickname 
even in Leinwan, do they?

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:52.920
In that case, I take it that you've 
also heard about my personality.

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:54.250
What are you going to do with us?

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:55.500
I'm taking you with me.

00:03:57.120 --> 00:03:58.460
Relax, I won't kill you.

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:01.050
So long as you don't resist, that is.

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:11.850
Makarov!

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:22.740
Eirote!

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:45.970
Keep moving!

00:04:47.190 --> 00:04:49.220
What <i>is </i>this place?

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:52.470
This is Skid, a stronghold 
belonging to Scarlet.

00:04:52.980 --> 00:04:55.230
It looks like the Fortress, 
where we found those Bugs.

00:04:55.230 --> 00:04:58.440
This is one of the ruins that were 
originally called fortresses.

00:04:58.890 --> 00:05:02.400
Except this one is operational.

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:04.400
How do you know how to use it?

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:07.280
How did you know we were coming?

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:08.870
You'll see soon enough.

00:05:11.310 --> 00:05:13.830
If you'll come with me, Your Highness?

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:15.790
Let's have a nice, leisurely chat, shall we?

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:18.960
Show the two Guardians to the beach.

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:20.460
They can keep their weapons.

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:24.440
After all, there's no point in 
trying to disarm a D-Knight.

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:39.360
Chris...

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:40.810
Miss Winia!

00:05:40.810 --> 00:05:45.690
I'm sorry, I had to stay at my job 
at the bakery later than I expected!

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:46.460
Huh?

00:05:46.460 --> 00:05:47.430
Whoa!

00:05:47.940 --> 00:05:49.570
Um, why are you wearing that?

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:53.120
The bakery owner gave it to 
me in lieu of severance pay.

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:54.750
Let's go, shall we?

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:55.200
Right.

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:58.290
But are you sure you want to do this?

00:05:58.290 --> 00:05:59.710
Of course!

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:01.710
The long journey to the capital of Sauer

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:04.670
is fraught with peril for 
a lone, delicate maiden.

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:08.130
Providing a safe escort is just 
another part of my knight's training!

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:09.640
Thank you.

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:13.410
Now then, let's be off!

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:19.560
This young man's name is Christopher.

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:22.980
He had been given orders to 
terminate the Scrapped Princess,

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:25.030
but I removed him from those duties.

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:27.740
At the moment, I have assigned 
him as Prince Forsyth's guard,

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:30.700
as well as to that other investigation.

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:32.490
It is an honor to be 
received by Your Majesty.

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:34.660
I see.

00:06:35.220 --> 00:06:38.460
I was responsible for a cruel duty being 
placed on your shoulders, as well.

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:41.460
You mustn't blame yourself, Majesty.

00:06:42.180 --> 00:06:45.750
It is because you risked 
your life to save her

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:49.280
that the princess has 
grown up safe and healthy.

00:06:49.280 --> 00:06:52.480
But imprisoned here as I am,

00:06:52.480 --> 00:06:55.930
I am unable to do anything 
for my fugitive daughter.

00:06:57.040 --> 00:06:59.870
Please tell me about her.

00:06:59.870 --> 00:07:00.390
Yes, Majesty.

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:05.730
Princess Pacifica was traveling 
under the protection

00:07:05.730 --> 00:07:07.940
of her adoptive brother and sister.

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:09.360
Her brother and sister?

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:13.040
What of her foster parents?

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:20.000
I am told that their mother passed away 
from an illness several years ago.

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:24.840
Their father lost his life in a heroic battle

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:27.960
against assassins who were 
attempting to kill the princess.

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:36.680
Surely that child must be cursing her fate...

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:37.640
No, Majesty.

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:41.140
When I saw the princess, she appeared to me

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:43.430
to be most cheerful and openhearted.

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:47.070
I see.

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:53.740
Wha...?

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:08.420
Before we begin, let me make 
one thing perfectly clear.

00:08:09.860 --> 00:08:12.380
I can't stand you.

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:18.270
Looks like this whole promontory 
is one enormous fortress.

00:08:18.270 --> 00:08:18.810
Yes.

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:22.890
The first order of business is to 
find where they're holding Pacifica.

00:08:22.890 --> 00:08:24.690
I'll take some hostages, so you...

00:08:24.690 --> 00:08:26.770
Abide, my master.

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:29.320
Any rash actions would be dangerous.

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:31.240
You do not know your 
opponent's true motives yet.

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:33.450
That's why there's no time to waste!

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:36.740
Had she intended to kill her, she would 
have done so at the first opportunity.

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:39.450
But that doesn't mean that 
she won't hurt her, <i>does </i>it?

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:40.490
Shannon...

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:43.710
Or will you do something to help?

00:08:43.710 --> 00:08:46.880
I am unable to meddle in 
squabbles between humans.

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:50.470
Those people called me a D-Knight.

00:08:50.470 --> 00:08:53.300
Other than you, the only people

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:55.720
who knew that word were those Peacemakers.

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:59.180
If they were in contact with 
Peacemakers, I would know.

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:02.810
Still, I am detecting a number of 
odd signatures from this place.

00:09:03.190 --> 00:09:04.310
What?

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:06.270
I intend to look into it right now.

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:09.770
Act with the utmost caution.

00:09:10.160 --> 00:09:10.730
Hey!

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:12.690
What?

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:15.070
Don't fly off the handle, Shannon.

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:16.280
If we do anything rash,

00:09:16.280 --> 00:09:19.360
we might accidentally put Pacifica in danger.

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:26.620
I'm surprised.

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:29.670
I was almost expecting you to break into 
tears and beg me to spare your life.

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:31.590
Y-You must be joking!

00:09:31.590 --> 00:09:33.180
I haven't even done anything wrong,

00:09:33.180 --> 00:09:35.590
so why should I have to 
beg you for forgiveness?!

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:36.590
Let me ask you this, then.

00:09:36.910 --> 00:09:38.720
If you haven't done anything wrong,

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:41.370
why are you on the run from 
people who want you dead?

00:09:41.370 --> 00:09:43.460
What do you mean? You know I'm...

00:09:44.470 --> 00:09:48.350
Your brother and sister risk their 
lives to protect you, don't they?

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:51.230
Is being protected all 
you're good for, Highness?

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:53.150
Why don't you even try to fight for yourself?

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:55.440
I <i>do </i>want to fight!

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:57.480
But I don't know <i>how </i>to,

00:09:57.480 --> 00:09:59.160
and I'm not very strong.

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:01.920
What do you want to do with this world?

00:10:01.920 --> 00:10:02.780
What do you mean?

00:10:02.780 --> 00:10:06.040
Do you think that this is 
the way the world should be?

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:07.870
Um... It shouldn't?

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:10.420
You're the Scrapped Princess 
who's meant to destroy the world!

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:14.050
If you felt like it, you could 
smash this stinking planet to bits!

00:10:14.050 --> 00:10:16.050
You know that, don't you?!

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:17.300
No, I don't.

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:19.890
Don't you even have any idea what you are?!

00:10:19.890 --> 00:10:23.850
You don't even know why the Grendel 
Revelation said to put you to death!

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:24.770
What is it with you?!

00:10:24.770 --> 00:10:26.850
If I don't know, I don't know!

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:30.480
Why do I have to destroy the world, anyway?

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:31.270
What did you say?

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:34.020
I <i>like </i>this world.

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:35.900
It's got lots of people that I care about.

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:39.700
I'd sooner die than destroy it.

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:40.240
I think.

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:42.910
I've had it with you.

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:46.750
I'm mad at myself for having even 
the slightest hopes for you.

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:48.960
You're no princess.

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:50.710
You're just the spoiled daughter of a queen.

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:53.360
All you'll ever do is run.

00:10:53.360 --> 00:10:57.210
W-Why should I have to put 
up with that from you?!

00:10:57.210 --> 00:10:59.240
I don't know if you're the 
Beast Princess or whatever,

00:10:59.240 --> 00:11:02.080
but how's about <i>you </i>start 
acting like royalty yourself?!

00:11:03.390 --> 00:11:05.100
I should tell you one thing.

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:08.360
I will make Shannon Cassul mine.

00:11:09.520 --> 00:11:11.600
What's that supposed to mean?

00:11:12.690 --> 00:11:15.210
Hey, wait a minute! You jerk!

00:11:16.120 --> 00:11:18.070
Why did you say those things to her?

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:22.200
Just looking at spoiled brats 
like her pisses me off.

00:11:22.530 --> 00:11:25.080
She takes it for granted 
that she'll be protected.

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:28.950
Each person has his own way of fighting.

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:32.170
When she said that she would choose 
death over destroying the world,

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:34.540
perhaps that was her own way of fighting.

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:36.920
That would be throwing your 
life away for nothing.

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:38.760
She doesn't know anything.

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:42.930
Surely you noticed that, Princess Senes.

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:44.800
Her abilities are indispensable to us.

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:46.220
All right, all right!

00:11:46.850 --> 00:11:48.600
I'll go meet with the D-Knight.

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:51.270
I'll let you deal with this one.

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:52.190
Yes, ma'am.

00:12:04.640 --> 00:12:05.620
This is...

00:12:06.560 --> 00:12:07.920
a Vanguard.

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:15.380
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:12:15.910 --> 00:12:17.630
What have you done with Pacifica?

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:19.010
She's fine.

00:12:19.010 --> 00:12:21.340
She's amusing herself by 
throwing pillows around.

00:12:21.340 --> 00:12:22.590
Pillows?

00:12:22.590 --> 00:12:23.840
What are you after?

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:25.410
I want you.

00:12:25.410 --> 00:12:26.800
I want to make you mine.

00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:27.810
What?

00:12:27.810 --> 00:12:29.310
My, how forward...

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:30.720
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:36.710
In short, what I want is the power 
of a fully operational Dragoon.

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:40.400
You've certainly picked up some 
strange bits of knowledge.

00:12:40.400 --> 00:12:41.740
You might say that.

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:43.650
To what end?

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:44.910
World domination.

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:47.870
That look on your face says, 
"Stop kidding around."

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:49.970
But if you ask me,

00:12:49.970 --> 00:12:54.000
<i>you </i>people are the ones who don't 
know what you're capable of.

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:56.040
What if I say no?

00:12:56.040 --> 00:12:57.580
The Scrapped Princess dies.

00:12:58.290 --> 00:13:00.080
Or so I'd like to say,

00:13:00.080 --> 00:13:03.220
but that sort of thing isn't my 
style, to tell you the truth.

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:09.300
I've always wanted to go at it with people 
armed with the same weapons as me.

00:13:09.300 --> 00:13:11.180
I'm gonna make you more agreeable.

00:13:14.680 --> 00:13:16.190
Shall we get to it, then?

00:13:16.680 --> 00:13:18.690
You can join in if you want.

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:22.360
I don't think that will be necessary.

00:13:22.980 --> 00:13:24.780
You're awfully confident...

00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:26.990
That means you'll be worth my time.

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:29.990
Hey, come back here, Beast Princess!

00:13:29.990 --> 00:13:32.950
If you don't come back here, 
I'm gonna smash this door down!

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:36.820
Here.

00:13:36.820 --> 00:13:38.170
Oh, thanks. Much obliged.

00:13:38.980 --> 00:13:41.840
How do you do, Pacifica Cassul?

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:42.630
Um, you are?

00:13:43.160 --> 00:13:46.590
Scarlet's second-in-command, Eirote Borchard.

00:13:49.280 --> 00:13:51.240
So, there was still one left...

00:13:52.530 --> 00:13:55.380
And in such good condition, too.

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:03.250
It's been a long time, Zefiris.

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:05.990
Do you recognize me?

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:08.820
Serial 14.

00:14:09.540 --> 00:14:10.840
Natalie, correct?

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:12.160
Yes,

00:14:13.220 --> 00:14:16.120
although I'm no longer a Dragoon.

00:14:31.060 --> 00:14:33.930
I admit, I underestimated you. I apologize.

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:37.140
You couldn't beat me, not 
even if you went all-out.

00:14:37.140 --> 00:14:38.350
We'll see about that.

00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:46.860
Come forth, my shield!

00:14:51.360 --> 00:14:55.160
You can use magic, too, huh? 
I wasn't expecting that.

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:56.290
You interested in joining the fight now?

00:14:58.040 --> 00:14:59.210
No, that's all right.

00:14:59.510 --> 00:15:01.500
You're one irritating family...

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:04.460
In that case, I'm going to 
take my time and enjoy this!

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:08.170
You two are a lot alike, 
you and Princess Senes.

00:15:08.530 --> 00:15:10.610
That Beast Princess and I are alike?

00:15:10.610 --> 00:15:11.890
Cut out the jokes, okay?

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:15.000
I'm nowhere near as violent as her.

00:15:15.520 --> 00:15:18.770
Admittedly, I'm not exactly 
genteel, myself...

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:22.580
You were born a princess, but were not loved,

00:15:22.580 --> 00:15:26.150
and attempts were made on 
your life from time to time.

00:15:26.150 --> 00:15:27.610
It was the same for Princess Senes.

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:30.960
The only difference is that

00:15:30.960 --> 00:15:36.530
her elder brother and sister 
never once protected her.

00:15:38.650 --> 00:15:41.010
When I first met her,

00:15:41.010 --> 00:15:46.460
Princess Senes was hiding in the bushes 
of the gardens of the royal palace.

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:51.130
Her brother had beaten her 
hard enough to draw blood.

00:15:54.120 --> 00:15:55.920
Why would he do that?

00:15:56.470 --> 00:15:59.640
Her mother, the Second 
Queen, hailed from a people

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:02.270
who were called a tribe of savages.

00:16:02.780 --> 00:16:06.610
Princess Senes surpassed her siblings 
in both the literary and military arts,

00:16:06.610 --> 00:16:09.230
so they feared she would 
steal the throne from them.

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:12.260
When I saw her battered body,

00:16:12.260 --> 00:16:16.200
I thought to myself, "I 
must protect this person."

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:19.490
It's odd, isn't it?

00:16:19.490 --> 00:16:23.460
I want to protect her, even though 
she is far stronger than I am.

00:16:23.460 --> 00:16:25.210
That's not strange at all.

00:16:25.210 --> 00:16:27.040
When the whole world has turned against you,

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:30.880
having just a single person on your side 
can give you the strength to go on.

00:16:31.520 --> 00:16:35.800
Pacifica, we're not your enemy.

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:41.700
Our real enemy isn't Leinwan 
or even the Church of Mauser.

00:16:41.700 --> 00:16:43.870
It's something else entirely.

00:16:43.870 --> 00:16:45.900
Our real enemy?

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:48.860
It was during that battle 5,000 years ago...

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:53.450
Afterwards, with my master lost and 
with damage extending to my base logic,

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:55.580
I was forced to make a choice.

00:16:55.580 --> 00:16:57.360
Do nothing and perish,

00:16:57.360 --> 00:17:01.290
or transplant my personality into 
the systems of this Vanguard?

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:03.080
That's crazy.

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:04.390
I suppose it was.

00:17:04.390 --> 00:17:05.920
It wasn't a complete success.

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:08.180
I've run self-reconstructions 
again and again,

00:17:08.180 --> 00:17:10.380
and I've slept most of this time.

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:15.290
So, you've locked down your functions 
and avoided Peacemaker detection...

00:17:15.290 --> 00:17:16.210
Yes.

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:20.180
That is how I have survived 
these 5,000 years.

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:22.890
I was frightened. Of my 
personality being extinguished.

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:25.910
Zefiris... Doesn't that terrify you, too?

00:17:26.640 --> 00:17:27.690
From what I can see,

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:31.140
you've been expanding your 
capabilities through self-upgrades,

00:17:31.790 --> 00:17:34.420
but if you overexert yourself, 
you'll trigger a self-destruct.

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:36.910
We are weapons.

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:38.660
If it will complete our objective,

00:17:38.660 --> 00:17:40.410
why would we hesitate?

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:43.510
My only concern is to fulfill his wishes.

00:17:43.510 --> 00:17:46.330
To carry out Lord Becknam's orders.

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:50.210
But you've found a new master.

00:17:50.210 --> 00:17:52.300
He is a substitute, nothing more.

00:17:52.300 --> 00:17:57.830
I have no intention of ever forgiving 
myself for failing to protect my master.

00:17:58.290 --> 00:17:59.930
That sounds like you.

00:18:00.900 --> 00:18:03.350
I've been waiting, Zefiris.

00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:06.460
For you... and the Scrapped Princess.

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:22.640
Stay out of this!

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:27.080
I want to make this bastard 
surrender, if only out of spite.

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:28.500
Hurry up and give it your best shot.

00:18:33.360 --> 00:18:35.090
Flames, burn bright!

00:18:47.930 --> 00:18:50.350
What are you people trying to do?

00:18:50.880 --> 00:18:54.440
Are you really trying to conquer 
the world, like you said?

00:18:54.440 --> 00:18:58.360
What, hasn't your Dragoon told you anything?

00:18:58.930 --> 00:19:00.110
What?

00:19:00.610 --> 00:19:04.580
There are things that rule over our world.

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:05.940
They never show themselves,

00:19:05.940 --> 00:19:08.580
but they are beings that control this world.

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:10.120
Beings that aren't human.

00:19:11.510 --> 00:19:13.130
Aren't human?

00:19:13.830 --> 00:19:15.590
You know about them, don't you?

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:17.550
Those monsters that are after you.

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:18.930
The Peacemakers.

00:19:21.330 --> 00:19:23.550
Lady Senes. Lady Borchard.

00:19:23.910 --> 00:19:25.510
Please come at once.

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:27.970
She has awoken.

00:19:28.920 --> 00:19:31.440
Damn, I guess I'd better go.

00:19:32.050 --> 00:19:37.030
If I let this chance slip by, there's 
no telling when she'll wake up again.

00:19:39.490 --> 00:19:41.950
Come on. I'll let you see your sister.

00:19:45.280 --> 00:19:46.410
Oh, you're okay?

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:49.080
Don't give me that!

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:53.170
You swore to protect me, so 
see it through, you jerk!

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:55.670
I guess we didn't need to worry.

00:19:55.670 --> 00:19:56.750
It looks that way.

00:19:57.500 --> 00:20:02.630
This Skid's official designation is 
a Vanguard Free Trajectory Fortress.

00:20:02.630 --> 00:20:05.140
It's a vehicle dating from the Genesis Wars.

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:06.760
A vehicle? This?!

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:12.450
We've learned how to operate it from a 
being that is sleeping in the fortress.

00:20:12.450 --> 00:20:15.280
She told <i>us</i>, more like.

00:20:15.280 --> 00:20:17.860
She's the one who made contact with us.

00:20:17.860 --> 00:20:18.730
"She"? Who do you mean?

00:20:19.060 --> 00:20:22.070
She has lost the majority of her power,

00:20:22.070 --> 00:20:25.260
but she is the being that we 
call "the last demon beast."

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:31.300
Zefiris...

00:20:32.130 --> 00:20:33.620
Now I get it.

00:20:34.340 --> 00:20:36.900
So, this is your Dragoon, huh?

00:20:36.900 --> 00:20:39.050
Who's that one, then?

00:20:39.050 --> 00:20:42.130
My personal identification is Natalie.

00:20:42.900 --> 00:20:47.600
You must be the Providence 
Breaker and her Guardians.

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:21.730
<i>A blessing of rain falls quietly. (Falls.)</i>

00:21:21.730 --> 00:21:27.050
<i>Droplets of my love, 
which fall for someone...</i>

00:21:27.050 --> 00:21:34.230
<i>who is still waiting in a land far away.</i>

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:40.020
<i>The morning wind blows, caressing 
my cheek. (What was that...)</i>

00:21:40.020 --> 00:21:45.150
<i>Did you feel something, feel something 
just now? (...on my cheek?)</i>

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:48.320
<i>It goes up to the one and only sky... 
(More certain than anything.)</i>

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:53.370
<i>a sky which has a fixed, certain meaning.</i>

00:21:53.370 --> 00:21:59.920
<i>I come to a stop in the shadow 
of clouds that chase after me.</i>

00:21:59.920 --> 00:22:03.380
<i>This journey of the heart 
that I wish to gaze upon...</i>

00:22:03.380 --> 00:22:06.590
<i>goes on forever and goes on forever.</i>

00:22:06.590 --> 00:22:13.220
<i>One day I will chance upon the 
voice I've not heard in so long.</i>

00:22:13.220 --> 00:22:15.180
<i>Alainn la-li-la.</i>

00:22:15.180 --> 00:22:19.900
<i>At last the ship sets sail, sets sail. 
(The ship glides on forever...)</i>

00:22:19.900 --> 00:22:25.190
<i>Yes, believe in this wide world... 
(...to the edge of seas unknown.)</i>

00:22:25.190 --> 00:22:28.530
<i>and go off into the distance.</i>

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:32.630
<i>And onwards into the future.</i>

00:22:33.490 --> 00:22:46.510
"Next Time"

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:36.200
The three siblings learn

00:22:36.200 --> 00:22:38.960
the truth about their world from 
Natalie, ruler of the fortress.

00:22:38.960 --> 00:22:41.500
It seems like they're being 
told crucial information,

00:22:41.500 --> 00:22:43.500
but to Pacifica, it is complete gibberish.

00:22:43.500 --> 00:22:46.050
It concerns her directly, so that 
can't be a good thing, can it?

00:22:46.050 --> 00:22:47.560
Next time on <i>Scrapped Princess</i>,

00:22:47.560 --> 00:22:48.970
"Battle Hymn of the Two Princesses."

00:22:48.970 --> 00:22:50.510
Please tune in!
